-- smucclaw/l4-ide#1102: a constant from an imported module that does not
-- type-check is not closed, so it is refused (Blocking) rather than copied.
-- Before, it was copied as `typeRef="number"` with the text "three", and the
-- export reported nothing worse than Advisory.
-- The export's exit code on this file (0, where `l4 check` exits 1) is
-- smucclaw/l4-ide#1110, not fixed here.
IMPORT `export-imported-unchecked-lib`

GIVEN h IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `pay` h IS h TIMES `the rate`
